_log": "Your hands now hold the trombone the way trombonists do: the left hand grips the slide brace and wraps the bell brace, with the first finger up by the mouthpiece, and the right hand holds the slide brace lightly between thumb and fingertips. The hands are now see-through gloves. The note display stays level and turns to face you however you hold the trombone. No more loading screen. Fixed a crash.", "created_date": 1792590221, "id": "29763165506603775", "version": "1.4.1", "version_code": 21, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7342599042420408", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29769555339298125"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "222012607382595"}]}, "change_log": "Record yourself playing and save it as a video: open the menu, press Start Recording, play, then press Save Video. Fixed an audio bug.", "created_date": 1792372694, "id": "29725587373694922", "version": "1.4.0", "version_code": 20, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7342599042420408", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29769555339298125"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "222012607382595"}]}, "change_log": "The stick picks a partial by the way you point it again, so any partial is one push away. The menu-button hint now sits on the \u2261 button.", "created_date": 1792299775, "id": "29712985754955084", "version": "1.3.0", "version_code": 19, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7342599042420408", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29769555339298125"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "222012607382595"}]}, "change_log": "A quick, sharp trigger pull now punches the note, and a note starts the moment you pull the trigger. Trombonest no longer asks for the advertising ID.", "created_date": 1792281697, "id": "29710255605228099", "version": "1.2.6", "version_code": 18, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}